DOCKER_IMAGE_PH_PIHOLE= # recommended=mpgirro/pihole-unbound:latest | type=string | prompt=select the pihole docker image | instruction=Literally the only image, pick just this one | choices=[mpgirro/pihole-unbound:latest] | immutable=true | description=The docker image for pihole-unbound. This is the image that will be used to create the pihole container. It is recommended to use the latest tag to always get the latest version of the image. The mpgirro/pihole-unbound image is a custom image that includes both pihole and unbound, which allows you to have a local DNS resolver with pihole's ad-blocking capabilities.
DOCKER_IMAGE_PH_PIHOLE_TAG= # recommended=latest | type=string | prompt=Enter the version tag for the pihole-unbound docker image | instruction=there is only one option for this, just pick that one | choices=[latest] | immutable=true | description=The version of the docker image.
